Subject: [PATCH] Sisong 2.16-2: paper and dark blue colour schemes

The package list names sisong-2.16-2. The owner asked for the editor's
background to be a light yellow like paper, or a darker blue for a dark
desktop: Paper and Midnight Blue are its default schemes now, the panes
under the text follow the scheme, and the gutter strip is no longer a
black and white dither (ProseApps 0837994).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
